 "source": "Q186c (2026-10-04): female Z-Anatomy trunk (thorax + abdomen) refit onto HER OWN CT; scripts/zanatomy/trunk_refit_q186c.py (build flag --trunk-refit), measured by scripts/zanatomy/trunk_refit_q186c_audit.py. Build dir build/viewer_zan_female_trunkfix (build/viewer_zan_female untouched). Not published.",
